/div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"AI越幫你精打細算，房貸反而會越貴 美國房貸之所以便宜，一部分靠的是大多數人在利率下降時懶得轉貸；一旦AI代理提醒所有人及時再融資，這個期權被重新定價，房貸利率反而會上漲。 Money Stuff Money Stuff Learn More Gooder AI 房貸再融資 按小時計費 亞馬遜廣告 ETF避稅 second-price auction soft reserve price chandelier bid basis trade apprenticeship model withholding tax\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-moneystuff-ai越帮你精打细算-房贷反而会越贵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">37:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>AI越幫你精打細算，房貸反而會越貴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國房貸之所以便宜，一部分靠的是大多數人在利率下降時懶得轉貸；一旦AI代理提醒所有人及時再融資，這個期權被重新定價，房貸利率反而會上漲。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">房貸再融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"激光武器終於要實戰了：美軍已花 150 億研發 激光被稱為定向能武器裡的狙擊步槍，微波則是電子霰彈槍。美軍正在從研發轉向採購，但真正短缺的是廉價攔截器——能不能贏每一場交戰卻打不起，才是關鍵。 Odd Lots Odd Lots Why Laser Beams Are the Hottest New Tech in Defense 定向能武器 激光 導彈防禦 軍工 無人機 供應鏈 Directed Energy Weapons (DEW) High-Powered Microwave (HPM) SWaP Exquisite munition Shore power\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-oddlots-激光武器终于要实战了-美军已花-150-亿研发/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">53:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>激光武器終於要實戰了：美軍已花 150 億研發</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">激光被稱為定向能武器裡的狙擊步槍，微波則是電子霰彈槍。美軍正在從研發轉向採購，但真正短缺的是廉價攔截器——能不能贏每一場交戰卻打不起，才是關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">定向能武器</span><span class=\"tag\">激光</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"相信能成，所以從不準備：特技車王差點死在4000英尺峽谷 特技車王 Knievel 把「正面心態」當方法論：跳前不練車、不算角度、不測風險。心理學教授 Oettingen 的實驗表明，樂觀幻想不會助推成功，反而讓人癱瘓——Snake River 的失敗在點火前就已註定。 Cautionary Tales with Tim Harford Cautionary Tales Evel Knievel Faces the Abyss 積極心態 成功學 特技飛車 心理實驗 工程事故 風險決策 Positive Mental Attitude Manifesting Control Optimists X2 Skycycle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-cautionary-相信能成-所以从不准备-特技车王差点死在4000英尺峡谷/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">40:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></div>\n<h2>相信能成，所以從不準備：特技車王差點死在4000英尺峽谷</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特技車王 Knievel 把「正面心態」當方法論：跳前不練車、不算角度、不測風險。心理學教授 Oettingen 的實驗表明，樂觀幻想不會助推成功，反而讓人癱瘓——Snake River 的失敗在點火前就已註定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">積極心態</span><span class=\"tag\">成功學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI 巨頭 80% 企業收入來自 1% 客戶，多數靠 VC 續命 OpenAI 與 Anthropic 的企業收入 80% 來自 1% 的客戶，且多是靠 VC 補貼燒 token 的 AI 公司；肯付大錢的只有科技圈自己，VC 一斷，上萬億算力賬單率先爆。 Better Offline Better Offline Monologue: Concentration Risk 集中度風險 AI 泡沫 算力合同 OpenAI NVIDIA 風險投資 concentration risk take-or-pay agreement neocloud revenue backlog\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-04-betteroffline-ai-巨头-80-企业收入来自-1-客户-多数靠-vc-续命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">10:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0904</span></di